    { from: 10, to: 90, text: "Module 5: The rest of the platform." },
    { from: 100, to: 280, text: "The core pipeline handles the main edit. Around it sit four supporting systems." },
    // B-roll
    { from: 340, to: 540, text: "First: the B-roll sub-pipeline." },
    { from: 540, to: 740, text: "The Orchestrator agent plans which shots are needed. A separate Step Functions workflow handles the render queue." },
    { from: 740, to: 940, text: "Fargate workers render each B-roll clip in its own container." },
    { from: 940, to: 1140, text: "A Poller waits for all renders to complete - same async pattern as the main pipeline." },
    { from: 1140, to: 1380, text: "The Finalizer assembles all B-roll clips into the output package." },
    // Globe
    { from: 1500, to: 1700, text: "Second: the travel globe renderer." },
    { from: 1700, to: 1900, text: "When a video features travel between events, the system renders an animated globe showing the route." },
    { from: 1900, to: 2100, text: "Route data is aggregated from event metadata. A frame plan is computed for the animation." },
    { from: 2100, to: 2340, text: "A Fargate worker renders the globe frames using a custom container image built by CodeBuild and stored in ECR." },
    { from: 2340, to: 2580, text: "The frames are encoded to an MP4 clip that slots into the main compile job." },
    // Data layer
    { from: 2700, to: 2900, text: "Third: the data layer. Five stores, each chosen for a specific access pattern." },
    { from: 2900, to: 3100, text: "S3 holds three buckets: input videos, output cuts, and shared assets. It is the source of truth for all media." },
    { from: 3100, to: 3300, text: "DynamoDB stores video metadata and job state. Fast key-value lookups for the dashboard and pipeline checks." },
    { from: 3300, to: 3500, text: "OpenSearch handles semantic and full-text search over transcript embeddings. Find any moment across the entire video archive." },
    { from: 3500, to: 3700, text: "ElastiCache caches hot reads: the live dashboard state and current trend snapshots." },
    { from: 3700, to: 3900, text: "Aurora holds relational records where joins and transactions matter - billing, user permissions, job history." },
    // Eventing
    { from: 4020, to: 4220, text: "Fourth: the eventing layer. This is what makes the platform proactive, not just reactive." },
    { from: 4220, to: 4460, text: "EventBridge Scheduler runs cron jobs: trend scans, batch analysis of unprocessed clips." },
    { from: 4460, to: 4700, text: "EventBridge also routes real-time events from other parts of the system to the right workflow." },
    { from: 4700, to: 4900, text: "A Viral Trends agent scans social platforms and ranks emerging topics. A batch Analysis Scheduler processes the backlog overnight." },
    // Web platform
    { from: 5020, to: 5220, text: "Finally: the web platform. How a human actually operates VideoFlow." },
    { from: 5220, to: 5400, text: "CloudFront serves the Next.js app with caching and TLS. Amplify handles static and server-side rendering." },
    { from: 5400, to: 5600, text: "The dashboard shows live workflow status. The upload page accepts new footage. The MAM is the media asset manager - your full searchable video archive." },
    { from: 5600, to: 5800, text: "An Ant Design wizard guides you through storyboard creation. A FastAPI backend handles all API requests." },
    { from: 5800, to: 6e3, text: "That is the full platform. In the next module, we look at what makes it production-grade." }
